{%- comment -%}
  Snippet: bbi-homepage-schema — HOMEPAGE-CONTENT-DENSITY (2026-05-30)

  Page-specific JSON-LD for the homepage (templates/index.json). The homepage
  previously emitted only the sitewide CHROME graph (bbi-org-schema #organization
  + #website + bbi-localbusiness-schema #localbusiness) and NO page-level node.

  This snippet adds three page-specific lanes, all anchored to the existing chrome
  entities (no node redeclaration — references only):

    1. WebPage (#webpage)  — types the document; isPartOf → #website,
       about → #organization, primaryImageOfPage → the homepage hero, and
       mainEntity → the featured-categories ItemList below.
    2. ItemList (#featured-categories) — the four shop-the-catalog category tiles
       (Seating / Desks / Storage / Tables) mirrored from the bbi-shop section.
       Honest scope: entity-graph grounding only — ItemList earns no SERP carousel
       for non-Course/Movie/Recipe/Restaurant items (same limitation noted in
       bbi-itemlist-jsonld). These are CollectionPage links, not products, so no
       Product/offers node is emitted (avoids the invalid-Product trap).
    3. 3× Service — rendered via the shared bbi-service-jsonld snippet, mirroring
       the visible "Three services that come with every quote" section. Each gets
       a distinct id_suffix so the @ids do not collide. provider → #organization.

  Domain convention (matches bbi-blog-jsonld):
    - page node @id / url use canonical_url (brand domain, www.brantbusinessinteriors.com)
    - chrome references use shop.permanent_domain (#website / #organization) so they
      resolve to the exact @ids bbi-org-schema emits.

  Rendered from: a custom-liquid section (bbi-home-schema) in templates/index.json,
  after bbi-work and before the footer. Homepage-only — never include elsewhere.

  canonical_url on the homepage ends in a single trailing slash
  (https://www.brantbusinessinteriors.com/), so collection paths are appended
  directly (no remove_last / leading-slash needed) — no double-slash risk.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "@id": "{{ canonical_url }}#webpage",
      "url": "{{ canonical_url }}",
      "name": "Brant Business Interiors · OECM Furniture · Peterborough",
      "description": "Brant Business Interiors is a family-owned Ontario commercial office furniture dealer in Peterborough, supplying schools, hospitals, municipalities, and private offices since 1964. OECM Supplier Partner under Agreement 2025-470 — Ontario institutions can purchase without open tender.",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "https://{{ shop.permanent_domain }}/#website"
      },
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://{{ shop.permanent_domain }}/#organization"
      },
      "primaryImageOfPage": {
        "@type": "ImageObject",
        "url": "https://www.brantbusinessinteriors.com/cdn/shop/files/bbi-homepage-hero-2026-05-27.jpg",
        "width": 2308,
        "height": 1362
      },
      "mainEntity": {
        "@id": "{{ canonical_url }}#featured-categories"
      },
      "inLanguage": "en-CA"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ItemList",
      "@id": "{{ canonical_url }}#featured-categories",
      "name": "Business furniture categories",
      "itemListOrder": "https://schema.org/ItemListOrderAscending",
      "numberOfItems": 4,
      "itemListElement": [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 1,
          "name": "Seating",
          "url": "{{ canonical_url }}collections/seating"
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 2,
          "name": "Desks & Workstations",
          "url": "{{ canonical_url }}collections/desks"
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 3,
          "name": "Storage & Filing",
          "url": "{{ canonical_url }}collections/storage"
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 4,
          "name": "Tables & Boardroom",
          "url": "{{ canonical_url }}collections/boardroom"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>
{%- render 'bbi-service-jsonld',
    service_name: 'Office space planning',
    service_description: 'We take your floor plan or square footage and return a fully-specced layout, with seat counts, sightlines, and freight logistics accounted for. AutoCAD or PDF floor plans accepted; on-site measure available.',
    service_type: 'Office space planning',
    id_suffix: 'service-space-planning' -%}
